{"title":"Mirehide Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 41) · Monster drop: Ogre Charger, Mountain Ogre, Moonfane Moth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 41 <span class=\"muted\">(2906 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/bog-pelt\">Bog Pelt</a>, 6× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 1 of 86 looted corpses (1/86)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/86<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 1 of 318 looted corpses (1/318)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/318<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 2 of 1,131 looted corpses (1/566)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/566<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"mirehide-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/bog-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"\">Bog Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7783f8d6ecabaddc0d02.svg\" alt=\"Mirehide Torso\"></div><h3>Mirehide Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tailoring 41</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 3:43:13 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}